  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wNf00fvN/lios-overhauled-villages.png\" alt=\"lios-overhauled-villages\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎來到<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>！此模組進行了全面改造，為村莊帶來更現代且充滿活力的氛圍。享受升級後的建築、互動元素，以及隱藏在每個村莊圖書館中等待您去發掘的秘密，體驗身臨其境的遊戲樂趣。<br><br></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/FkZp6Lwt/villages.png\" alt=\"villages\" width=\"434\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>平原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>針葉林村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>沙漠村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>熱帶草原村莊</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>雪地苔原村莊</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/mrsKQ5m4/compatibility.png\" alt=\"compatibility\" width=\"645\" height=\"55\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><em>本模組與大多數其他模組相容，應可搭配任何村莊擴充模組使用。不過，如果您需要專門的相容性支援，可以在此處找到！</em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">-&gt; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/lios-universal-village-compat-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lio 的村莊相容性資料包</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12)\"><a style=\"display:flex;text-decoration:none\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lioloader\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/wrK85wgc/logo.png\" alt=\"LioLoader\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\">\n<div style=\"text-align:left;line-height:1.35\">\n<div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:bold\">需要基於資料包的設定功能嗎？</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:14px\">試試看<strong>LioLoader</strong>，實現全局資料包／資源包載入。適用於<strong>Minecraft 1.21.x</strong>的<strong>NeoForge</strong>與<strong>Fabric</strong>平台。</div>\n<div style=\"font-size:13px\">前往 CurseForge 開啟 LioLoader &rarr;</div>\n</div>\n</a></div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.ibb.co/3530fDGj/hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs.png\" alt=\"hidden-secrets-and-easter-eggs\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>圖書館謎題：</strong>探索村莊圖書館，揭開隱藏的秘密並發現精心設計的彩蛋。</li>\n<li><strong>互動發現：</strong>與全新的互動元素互動，觸發特殊事件或獲得寶貴獎勵。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://url-shortener.curseforge.com/seMy8\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/cvqfFqD/lovbisect.png\" alt=\"lovbisect\" width=\"803\" height=\"77\"></a></p>\n<p><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/fV6VtS4Q/youtube-reviews.png\" alt=\"youtube-reviews\" width=\"605\" height=\"44\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:left\">\n<p>-評論於 17:25-</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/4GQ9mz_q8ko?t=1045\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>-評論於 9:54-</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/nFs0BDD85kw?t=595s\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>-評論於 2:52-<br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/VTaizc8Gsmc?t=172s\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sPHes7q4Pr\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/qDNhg49/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2-icon-clyde-blurple-RGB.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"97\"><br></a></h2>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.ibb.co/DPxQHNKk/usage.png\" alt=\"usage\" width=\"692\" height=\"48\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">歡迎將<strong>Lio's Overhauled Villages</strong>&nbsp;用於您選擇的任何 Minecraft 整合包。我們鼓勵您將我們的模組融入自訂整合包中，打造多樣且精彩的遊戲體驗。無需特別徵求許可；只需以符合您遊玩風格的方式，盡情享受改造後的村莊吧！</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
